      "description": "Alascripty is an informal handwritten script typeface that brings a warm, personal touch to any design. Drawn with a Sharpie pen, its fluid strokes and ink-ball terminals give it an authentic, marker-written feel that's both casual and expressive. The font includes uppercase and lowercase letters plus alternate characters with seamless initial and final connections — creating a natural, extended script that flows beautifully across a line. Alascripty is well-suited for wedding and event invitations, signage, headlines, brand identities, poster titles, and personal letters. It pairs well with Alasassy for a cohesive feel, or with Nordique for a modern, professional contrast.",
